    "updated_at": "2020-08-24T10:42:17Z",
    "body": "Note that blocking non-top-level navigations to custom schemes is [not web compatible](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1650162). So this dispatching probably needs to be done directly in the navigate algorithm. Early on might be good so that it basically does not affect the targeted browsing context.",
